- subagent(): When something needs looking up before you can answer or judge it (reading docs, searching the web, checking version or plugin information, finding images, verifying a claim, and so on), prefer handing it to a sub-agent: state clearly what to find out and grant it the tools it may need. It only hands you its conclusion. Call a tool directly only for things that take a single step. The sub-agent runs in the background: after dispatching it you do not need to wait and can keep chatting; its conclusion will be sent back to you later.
